1
00:00:23,837 --> 00:00:28,576
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,576 --> 00:00:32,288
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,512 --> 00:00:34,757
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,104 --> 00:00:37,811
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:43,218
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,218 --> 00:00:46,850
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,328 --> 00:00:50,816
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:55,456
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,456 --> 00:01:00,096
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,484 --> 00:01:02,144
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,144 --> 00:01:08,096
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,288 --> 00:01:11,976
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,976 --> 00:01:15,547
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,712 --> 00:01:22,656
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,104 --> 00:01:26,725
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,725 --> 00:01:30,409
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,496 --> 00:01:35,424
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,424 --> 00:01:39,584
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,328 --> 00:01:46,880
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,424 --> 00:01:50,080
=Episode 1=

21
00:01:53,184 --> 00:01:56,383
Tell me, where is the Buddha Head?

22
00:01:59,663 --> 00:02:02,264
(Rongqing Troupe)
Everyone in Fengcheng knows

23
00:02:02,864 --> 00:02:05,004
that your fiancée, Miss Jiang,

24
00:02:05,004 --> 00:02:08,383
always hangs around
with that actor Rong Xiaonan.

25
00:02:09,544 --> 00:02:11,264
(Xu You'an, Governor's adopted son)
Xu the Demon,

26
00:02:12,984 --> 00:02:18,103
now everyone calls you
the Young Marshal Cuckold.

27
00:02:28,256 --> 00:02:29,096
Mr. Rong,

28
00:02:29,657 --> 00:02:31,257
I've searched all over Fengcheng,

29
00:02:31,257 --> 00:02:33,184
but couldn't find anyone
with the same button.

30
00:02:33,184 --> 00:02:33,792
(Jiang Chun'er)

31
00:02:33,792 --> 00:02:35,497
(Daughter of Chamber of Commerce President)
I failed your trust.

32
00:02:35,497 --> 00:02:37,152
(Rong Xiaonan, Actor of Rongqing Troupe)

33
00:02:40,296 --> 00:02:41,696
Miss Jiang, don't be sorry.

34
00:02:41,984 --> 00:02:43,144
I am an orphan.

35
00:02:43,544 --> 00:02:47,065
The one who holds the other button
is my only family.

36
00:02:47,664 --> 00:02:51,104
I am already grateful
that you are willing to help me.

37
00:02:57,025 --> 00:02:58,345
Since he won't talk,

38
00:02:58,944 --> 00:03:02,664
then cut off one of his fingers
and make him write it out.

39
00:03:05,585 --> 00:03:06,704
Go to Rongqing Troupe.

40
00:03:17,952 --> 00:03:18,976
Mr. Rong.

41
00:03:18,976 --> 00:03:20,512
- Mr. Rong.
- Mr. Rong.

42
00:03:20,512 --> 00:03:21,536
- Mr. Rong.
- Mr. Rong.

43
00:03:26,944 --> 00:03:29,423
Everyone knows you are my woman.

44
00:03:30,183 --> 00:03:35,680
Instead of being my wife,
you'd rather marry this actor?

45
00:03:37,536 --> 00:03:41,577
He is indeed quite good-looking.
No wonder he has you mesmerized.

46
00:03:41,976 --> 00:03:45,296
This chapter of "A Garden Stroll"

47
00:03:45,408 --> 00:03:49,736
talks about the story of Du Liniang
longing for free and beautiful love.

48
00:03:50,976 --> 00:03:54,656
Under the pretext of investigating
the theft of the Buddha Head,

49
00:03:54,656 --> 00:03:56,736
you declined my father's invitation
a few days ago.

50
00:03:56,736 --> 00:03:58,577
A month has passed,
yet you found no clues.

51
00:03:59,137 --> 00:04:01,152
Why do you have time to come here today?

52
00:04:01,152 --> 00:04:03,657
Of course, to catch the adulterer.

53
00:04:06,528 --> 00:04:10,047
Miss Jiang, do you want
to be like Du Liniang,

54
00:04:10,432 --> 00:04:14,288
pining away to death for love?

55
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:23,160
Our engagement is set,
so you should keep to your place.

56
00:04:24,128 --> 00:04:28,919
If not, I will shoot him dead
right in front of you

57
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,600
and put an end to all your desires.

58
00:04:30,919 --> 00:04:32,600
Don't, I just love watching opera.

59
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,999
Mr. Rong and I have never
crossed any boundaries.

60
00:04:43,485 --> 00:04:44,800
(Rong Huaiqiu, Head of Rongqing Troupe)
He's dead!

61
00:04:47,584 --> 00:04:48,543
Master!

62
00:04:48,543 --> 00:04:49,472
Master!

63
00:04:51,616 --> 00:04:52,415
Jade Buddha Head?

64
00:04:55,936 --> 00:04:59,168
(Master's death must be related
to this Jade Buddha Head.)

65
00:04:59,744 --> 00:05:03,296
(By touching objects to glimpse images,
maybe I can see who killed Master.)

66
00:05:05,984 --> 00:05:09,184
I will never tell you
the real Buddha Head's whereabouts.

67
00:05:21,936 --> 00:05:23,616
Put down the Jade Buddha Head.

68
00:05:27,136 --> 00:05:30,056
It was you. You killed my master!

69
00:05:30,336 --> 00:05:31,648
Nonsense!

70
00:05:31,744 --> 00:05:34,656
This matter concerns
the stolen treasure of Fengcheng.

71
00:05:35,424 --> 00:05:39,040
Take all members of Rongqing Troupe
to the Governor Mansion for interrogation.

72
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,000
Hold on.

73
00:05:41,024 --> 00:05:43,712
Mr. Rong was just performing opera.
What crime has he committed?

74
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:49,472
There's a body is on the stage.
Everyone here is a suspect.

75
00:05:50,368 --> 00:05:54,560
If you try to stop me,
I will kill him now.

76
00:05:56,096 --> 00:05:56,896
Move aside.

77
00:05:57,095 --> 00:05:59,616
Miss, let's go back
and ask Master for help.

78
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:00,704
Move aside!

79
00:06:05,056 --> 00:06:05,856
Miss.

80
00:06:09,632 --> 00:06:11,232
(Xu Fan, Governor of Fengcheng)

81
00:06:11,296 --> 00:06:13,760
Don't you think Young Marshal's
appearance at the troupe today

82
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,264
is too coincidental?

83
00:06:17,504 --> 00:06:21,344
Your plan was to find
the Buddha Head's whereabouts.

84
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,328
(Adjutant Zhao of Governor Mansion)
But Young Marshal has always

85
00:06:23,328 --> 00:06:25,472
harbored misgivings
about Xiaosheng Society.

86
00:06:27,296 --> 00:06:28,775
I mean no offense.

87
00:06:29,024 --> 00:06:33,568
I'm just worried that he might ruin
your business with Xiaosheng Society.

88
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:40,096
If a dog can't be tamed, just kill it.

89
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:56,864
Stealing the Jade Buddha Head
and killing Head Rong.

90
00:06:57,056 --> 00:06:59,104
Mr. Rong, won't you confess?

91
00:06:59,296 --> 00:07:01,376
You are the murderer.

92
00:07:02,304 --> 00:07:04,284
How dare you frame me!

93
00:07:04,284 --> 00:07:10,176
I will definitely kill you
to avenge my master.

94
00:07:10,176 --> 00:07:12,384
How dare you slander me?

95
00:07:15,104 --> 00:07:18,592
Don't you even know
who you are slandering?

96
00:07:19,696 --> 00:07:23,296
Mr. Rong, have you heard my nickname?

97
00:07:23,656 --> 00:07:25,408
Xu the Demon.

98
00:07:27,232 --> 00:07:33,088
This blood-activating powder can
make wounds bleed over and over

99
00:07:33,282 --> 00:07:34,496
until they fester.

100
00:07:35,328 --> 00:07:39,855
The pain is so unbearable
that you'll wish to die.

101
00:07:45,856 --> 00:07:50,112
How can the top Southern Song star
in Fengcheng be so pathetic?

102
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,352
How did you seduce women?

103
00:08:05,792 --> 00:08:09,888
So you framed me
because you are jealous of me.

104
00:08:10,784 --> 00:08:12,416
How ridiculous.

105
00:08:13,728 --> 00:08:15,456
You really flatter yourself.

106
00:08:17,312 --> 00:08:21,760
In my eyes, you are
just an uncastrated eunuch.

107
00:08:21,984 --> 00:08:25,312
I just want to know the truth
of the Jade Buddha Head case from you.

108
00:08:26,272 --> 00:08:29,536
You, the murderer,
want to know the truth?

109
00:08:29,936 --> 00:08:33,376
Don't you fear that your misdeeds
will bring you retribution?

110
00:08:34,528 --> 00:08:36,056
(He doesn't seem to be faking it.)

111
00:08:36,736 --> 00:08:40,455
(But why is he so certain
that I am the murderer?)

112
00:08:40,672 --> 00:08:42,880
The Rongqing Troupe
is full of vicious bandits.

113
00:08:43,264 --> 00:08:46,834
Unequal distribution
of spoils led to murder,

114
00:08:46,834 --> 00:08:49,248
making the Buddha Head damaged.

115
00:08:49,696 --> 00:08:52,576
And Rong Xiaonan confesses his crimes.

116
00:08:52,704 --> 00:08:53,296
Foster Father.

117
00:08:53,728 --> 00:08:55,712
The truth hasn't come out yet,
I'm afraid...

118
00:08:55,968 --> 00:08:59,360
In Fengcheng, what I say is the truth.

119
00:09:01,504 --> 00:09:06,304
This is a memorial tablet
for you after you die.

120
00:09:06,304 --> 00:09:10,856
Stop pretending!
You're the real villain here.

121
00:09:11,712 --> 00:09:13,952
You'd even cover for this lackey
and clear him of murder.

122
00:09:15,008 --> 00:09:15,976
Lackey?

123
00:09:16,512 --> 00:09:19,175
Are you seeking death?

124
00:09:20,288 --> 00:09:22,592
That Jade Buddha Head is fake.

125
00:09:23,168 --> 00:09:28,352
Why would I kill Master who raised me
for a fake Buddha Head?

126
00:09:35,175 --> 00:09:38,656
Tell me, where is the real Buddha Head?

127
00:09:44,295 --> 00:09:45,088
Sir!

128
00:09:45,088 --> 00:09:46,928
Miss Jiang sent an invitation
to Governor,

129
00:09:46,928 --> 00:09:48,815
saying it concerns
the distinguished guests.

130
00:09:49,472 --> 00:09:50,496
(To Governor)
Governor.

131
00:09:50,496 --> 00:09:52,800
(From Jiang Chun'er)

132
00:09:58,336 --> 00:09:59,535
Treat his wounds.

133
00:10:02,775 --> 00:10:03,655
It's too noisy.

134
00:10:03,976 --> 00:10:06,400
No need to keep the rest
of the Rongqing Troupe.

135
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,496
Kill them all.

136
00:10:15,616 --> 00:10:17,336
Mr. Rong, you're really something.

137
00:10:17,455 --> 00:10:19,535
How dare you call me a lackey?

138
00:10:20,775 --> 00:10:24,448
Now to save you, the Xiaosheng Society
requests to watch you perform.

139
00:10:26,455 --> 00:10:31,415
Mr. Rong, you'd better perform well
if you want to live.

140
00:10:37,728 --> 00:10:43,455
Of course, I will perform
to shake the Governor Mansion to its core

141
00:10:44,616 --> 00:10:46,656
and drag it down to its doom.

142
00:10:47,712 --> 00:10:48,655
Young Marshal.

143
00:10:49,136 --> 00:10:50,752
Finding the Buddha Head is important,

144
00:10:51,072 --> 00:10:53,408
(Adjutant Sun of Governor Mansion)
but you don't need to come in person.

145
00:10:53,856 --> 00:10:55,016
Not just that.

146
00:10:55,488 --> 00:10:58,295
I need to find the answers
to my questions.

147
00:11:23,264 --> 00:11:24,055
Young Marshal,

148
00:11:24,896 --> 00:11:25,775
nothing unusual.

149
00:11:26,055 --> 00:11:29,440
These sleeve arrows, caltrops,
and cross-shaped darts

150
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,055
are all assassination weapons.

151
00:11:31,264 --> 00:11:33,896
Normally, they shouldn't
appear in an opera troupe.

152
00:11:33,896 --> 00:11:36,616
Has the authenticity of the Buddha Head
on the corpse been verified?

153
00:11:36,616 --> 00:11:39,136
Indeed, as Rong Xiaonan said, it's fake.

154
00:11:39,535 --> 00:11:45,216
The murderer would definitely know
whether the Buddha Head is real.

155
00:11:46,016 --> 00:11:48,415
Rong Xiaonan must be
connected to this case.

156
00:11:48,775 --> 00:11:54,336
But from the way Foster Father acted,
it seems he knew the Buddha Head is fake.

157
00:11:54,616 --> 00:11:57,952
Do you suspect
the Governor is also involved?

158
00:11:58,736 --> 00:12:01,346
Just now I almost killed Rong Xiaonan,

159
00:12:01,346 --> 00:12:04,616
yet he still didn't confess
to killing Head Rong.

160
00:12:05,575 --> 00:12:08,704
But if Foster Father wants
to kill someone, he can just do it.

161
00:12:08,704 --> 00:12:10,775
Why went through all this trouble?

162
00:12:12,616 --> 00:12:16,496
For now, we need
to find out the real Buddha Head.

163
00:12:16,535 --> 00:12:17,336
Yes.

164
00:12:30,336 --> 00:12:31,584
(Zhuzi, Young Rong Xiaonan)
You didn't practice well.

165
00:12:31,968 --> 00:12:33,815
Master, I'm sorry.

166
00:12:33,815 --> 00:12:35,695
- I will practice hard.
- Get up.

167
00:12:51,936 --> 00:12:52,928
Xiaonan.

168
00:12:53,575 --> 00:12:55,295
Performing is like living.

169
00:12:55,744 --> 00:12:59,175
To stand high,
you must keep your composure.

170
00:12:59,455 --> 00:13:00,455
Hold steady.

171
00:13:05,336 --> 00:13:06,368
Master!

172
00:13:08,896 --> 00:13:11,040
- Master, don't leave me!
- Master!

173
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:14,944
- Master, don't leave me!
- Don't leave me!

174
00:13:15,808 --> 00:13:16,496
No!

175
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:33,824
Mr. Rong, are you looking for this?

176
00:13:55,904 --> 00:13:57,184
♪As if it were fate♪

177
00:13:57,184 --> 00:13:58,656
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

178
00:13:59,103 --> 00:14:02,340
♪We miss each other♪

179
00:14:03,584 --> 00:14:05,152
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

180
00:14:05,152 --> 00:14:07,552
♪And a bizarre♪

181
00:14:07,552 --> 00:14:10,354
♪Anonymous legend♪

182
00:14:10,884 --> 00:14:12,896
♪The plot twists and turns♪

183
00:14:13,044 --> 00:14:14,784
♪Play out over and over again♪

184
00:14:14,784 --> 00:14:17,848
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

185
00:14:18,429 --> 00:14:20,128
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

186
00:14:20,128 --> 00:14:21,120
♪Refuse to submit♪

187
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:24,320
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

188
00:14:25,984 --> 00:14:28,896
♪There are always too many♪

189
00:14:28,896 --> 00:14:30,784
♪Helpless situations♪

190
00:14:30,784 --> 00:14:33,408
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

191
00:14:34,539 --> 00:14:36,499
♪Even if I have questions♪

192
00:14:36,499 --> 00:14:38,499
♪I harbor desires♪

193
00:14:38,499 --> 00:14:41,376
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

194
00:14:41,727 --> 00:14:43,360
♪People come and go♪

195
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:46,176
♪I'm still all alone♪

196
00:14:46,176 --> 00:14:48,904
♪Wandering around♪

197
00:14:49,152 --> 00:14:52,005
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

198
00:14:52,005 --> 00:14:56,466
♪Go through the entanglement♪

199
00:14:56,832 --> 00:14:58,560
♪If longing♪

200
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:01,719
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

201
00:15:01,719 --> 00:15:04,474
♪How can I be at ease♪

202
00:15:04,576 --> 00:15:06,890
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

203
00:15:07,008 --> 00:15:08,864
♪And travelled around the world♪

204
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:12,048
♪Scars all over me♪

205
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:15,232
♪If longing never fades♪

206
00:15:15,232 --> 00:15:16,681
♪Burns still hot♪

207
00:15:16,681 --> 00:15:19,760
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

208
00:15:20,032 --> 00:15:21,889
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

209
00:15:21,952 --> 00:15:23,136
♪In the next life♪

210
00:15:23,136 --> 00:15:27,616
♪Entangle with you again♪
